        "message": {
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "reasoning",
              "text": "The 定稿 R3: gap faces LEFT (like a backwards C / \"Ɔ\"?). Actually looking at the image, the gap is on the left side. Let me confirm: the current R43 has gap on right. R3 定稿 gap on left.\n\nSo answer: 缺口朝左 (朝西)。Current draft differs — gap faces right.\n\nNote the user asked \"同时看当前版本\" — so mention the difference.\n\nLet me be careful about the visual: in R3 image, the ring opening is at the left (the two ends are at upper-left and lower-left). Yes gap faces left.\n\nI'll answer concisely."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**定稿的缺口朝左（西侧）**。\n\n| 版本 | 缺口方向 |\n|---|---|\n| R3 “泊位图标 · 定稿”（已保存） | 朝左，开口在西侧，两端的切口位于左上和左下 |\n| R43 “泊位图标 · 当前稿”（本次附上的图） | 朝右，开口在东侧，相当于把定稿水平镜像过来 |\n\n也就是说，两版在水平方向上正好相反。当前稿的缺口朝右，而定稿的缺口朝左；如果这轮要做成和定稿一致，就需要把缺口翻转回左侧。\n\n需要我把 G1 里的 R1 初稿也调出来，看看缺口方向是怎么演变的吗？"
            }
          ],
